**Plan**
- Define a serializable LevelEntry (display name and scene name) and expose a list in the inspector.
- Read the unlocked level count from PlayerPrefs and build one button per level inside a ScrollView.
- Locked levels get a lock marker and are disabled; unlocked ones load their scene on click.

```csharp
using System;
using System.Collections.Generic;
using UnityEngine;
using UnityEngine.SceneManagement;
